 Urban U5 different from a regular backpack?<\/strong>","text":"<p>It combines a flip-top quick-access design + full clamshell opening, giving you both fast daily access and full packing visibility. This dual-system structure is rare in urban backpacks and improves efficiency for commuting and travel.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_arN4gg":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Is U5 suitable for business trips and commuting?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Yes. It is optimized for business commuting and short trips, featuring a luggage pass-through, laptop protection compartment, and quick-access pockets for passports, phones, and daily essentials.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_MheQRM":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What is the difference between U5 and U6?<\/strong>","text":"<p><a href=\"\/products\/nayo-smart-urban-u5-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Urban U5 Backpack-White\">U5<\/a> prioritizes a flap silhouette and full-open access. <br\/><a href=\"\/products\/nayo-smart-urban-u6-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Urban U6 Backpack\">U6<\/a> prioritizes lower weight, a cleaner commuter shape and quick-access details.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_4UqfNB":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What kind of lifestyle fits U5 backpack best?<\/strong>","text":"<p>It fits a fast-paced urban lifestyle—commuters, consultants, designers, startup professionals, and digital nomads who need a clean, functional, and professional-looking everyday backpack.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_6JfjPV":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What is the main function of U5 backpack?<\/strong>","text":"<p>The Urban U5 is built for organized daily carry + short business travel. It fits a 16-inch laptop, tech gear, documents, and 1–3 days of essentials while keeping e